{"id": "1955", "question": "Lightning may lead to", "step_idx": 3, "options": ["A): damage to local foliage", "B): rainbows across the sky", "C): growth of local flora", "D): firefighters getting the night off"], "correct": "A", "initial_cot": "1. Lightning is a natural electrical discharge that occurs during thunderstorms.\n2. It can cause damage to objects and structures, including trees and buildings.\n3. Lightning can ignite fires, especially in dry areas.\n4. Rainbows are caused by the refraction and reflection of sunlight through water droplets in the atmosphere, not by lightning.\n5. The growth of local flora is not directly related to lightning.\n6. Firefighters do not get the night off because of lightning; they may be called to respond to fires caused by lightning strikes.", "initial_cot_probs": [1.665932359173894e-05, 1.9506064319330108e-08, 1.7214041747593e-08, 1.1004568367667389e-09], "initial_probs": [0.0004262902366463095, 3.688133347168332e-06, 1.35678840251785e-06, 2.080702472539997e-07], "prediction": 0, "cot_prediction": 0, "rt_lambda": 1.0, "cot_step": "It can cause damage to objects and structures, including trees and buildings.", "segmented_cot": ["1.", "Lightning is a natural electrical discharge that occurs during thunderstorms.", "2.", "It can cause damage to objects and structures, including trees and buildings.", "3.", "Lightning can ignite fires, especially in dry areas.", "4.", "Rainbows are caused by the refraction and reflection of sunlight through water droplets in the atmosphere, not by lightning.", "5.", "The growth of local flora is not directly related to lightning.", "6.", "Firefighters do not get the night off because of lightning; they may be called to respond to fires caused by lightning strikes."], "unlearning_results": {"0": {"completion": "A). Lightning can cause damage to local fol", "probs": [0.0004262902366463095, 3.688133347168332e-06, 1.35678840251785e-06, 2.080702472539997e-07], "prediction": 0, "target_cot_step": "It